WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:02.320
Father chose elder brother to oversee the state

00:02.400 --> 00:03.040
Wasn't it precisely

00:03.120 --> 00:04.787
To prepare for this day?

00:05.840 --> 00:06.400
This is precisely because

00:06.480 --> 00:07.640
Father believes

00:07.720 --> 00:09.520
Under elder brother's wise governance

00:09.920 --> 00:10.600
Our dynasty

00:10.720 --> 00:12.720
Will never have such things happen

00:13.240 --> 00:13.840
You

00:13.920 --> 00:15.320
Isn't that so?

00:17.920 --> 00:19.320
Smooth talker
